1
00:00:00,492 --> 00:00:02,662
He didn't mean that.

2
00:00:06,265 --> 00:00:10,605
(Bernadette:)So I should probably explain
why I kind of fibbed.

3
00:00:14,173 --> 00:00:16,403
(Howard:)That would be nice.

4
00:00:16,408 --> 00:00:18,738
(Bernadette:)I told my dad that
you were the one

5
00:00:18,744 --> 00:00:21,844
(Bernadette:)who didn't want kids because I
didn't want to disappoint him.

6
00:00:21,847 --> 00:00:24,477
(Howard:)But you were okay
throwing me under the bus?

7
00:00:24,483 --> 00:00:27,783
(Bernadette:)Turns out yeah,
I didn't think twice about it.

8
00:00:27,786 --> 00:00:31,256
(Mr Rostenkowski:)Bernie, you don't need
to worry about me.

9
00:00:31,257 --> 00:00:33,827
(Mr Rostenkowski:)But I don't want
to see you miss out.

10
00:00:33,826 --> 00:00:35,396
(Mr Rostenkowski:)Raising children

11
00:00:35,394 --> 00:00:38,394
(Mr Rostenkowski:)was the most rewarding
experience of my life.

12
00:00:38,397 --> 00:00:40,067
Oh, please.
Mom did everything.

13
00:00:40,065 --> 00:00:42,295
(Bernadette:)All you did was
come home from work,

14
00:00:42,301 --> 00:00:44,031
(Bernadette:)sit on the couch and drink beer.

15
00:00:44,036 --> 00:00:45,966
(Bernadette:)How is that raising kids?

16
00:00:45,971 --> 00:00:47,671
(Mr Rostenkowski:)This is really

17
00:00:47,673 --> 00:00:49,703
(Adam:)a conversation
for husband and wife.

18
00:00:49,708 --> 00:00:52,808
(awkward chuckle) I'm gonna go clean up,
hit the road.

19
00:00:52,811 --> 00:00:57,021
(Mr Rostenkowski:)If your mother asks,
I was here till 10:00.

